WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:11.378
Oh God said to Abraham,
Kill me a son

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:14.614
Abe says, "Man, you must be
puttin' me on"

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.917
God say, No. Abe say, What?

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.754
God say, You can do
what you want Abe, but

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:24.691
The next time you see me comin
you better run

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.234
Well Abe says, Where do you
want this killin done?

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:37.570
God says, Out on Highway 61

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:47.447
Well Georgia Sam
he had a bloody nose

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.583
Welfare Department they
wouldnt give him no clothes

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.920
He asked poor Howard
where can I go

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.990
Howard said theres only
one place I know

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:00.994
Sam said tell me quick man
I got to run

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:09.569
Ol Howard just pointed
with his gun

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:13.606
And said that way down
on Highway 61

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:22.949
Well Mack the Finger said
to Louie the King

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:25.885
I got forty red, white and
blue shoestrings

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:29.689
And a thousand telephones
that don't ring

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:32.525
Do you know where I can
get rid of these things

00:01:32.525 --> 00:01:36.963
And Louie the King said
let me think for a minute son

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.572
And he said yes I think
it can be easily done

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.975
Just take everything
down to Highway 61

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:58.751
Now the fifth daughter
on the twelfth night

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:02.088
Told the first father that
things werent right

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:05.592
My complexion she said
is much too white

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:08.428
He said come here and
step into the light,

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:10.296
he says hmm youre right

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:13.133
Let me tell the second mother
this has been done

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.474
But the second mother was with
the seventh son

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:25.311
And they were both
out on Highway 61

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:38.758
Now the rovin gambler
he was very bored

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:41.327
He was tryin to create
a next world war

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:44.831
He found a promoter who
nearly fell off the floor

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:48.001
He said I never engaged
in this kind of thing before

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:52.338
But yes I think it can be
very easily done

00:02:57.744 --> 00:03:01.381
Well just put some bleachers
out in the sun

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:04.817
And have it on Highway 61

